  "notes": "Materials wood_*, stone_*, glass_* share the same pieces (pixel size): block 70x70, short 140x70 (horizontal), plank 220x70 (long horizontal), pillar 70x140 (upright), beam 70x220 (tall upright), big 140x140, ball 70x70 (circle), tri 140x70 (triangle roof). Each has a cracked twin with _dmg (e.g. wood_plank_dmg) to swap in when damaged. tnt_block / tnt_block_dmg 70x70 explodes. Aliens (targets) 70x70: alien_beige|blue|green|pink|yellow + _round, _square or _suit. Debris: debrisglass_1..3, debrisstone_1..3, debriswood_1..3 (40px chips for break effects). Ground tiles 70x70: grass, dirt, sand, snow; props rock, bush, cactus; stargold/starsilver/starbronze for level stars; coingold; flagred/flaggreen. Backgrounds 768x768 full scenes (sky at top, hills at bottom): colored_grass, colored_desert, colored_land. Sounds: bump (impact), hurt, disappear (pop), throw (launch), coin, magic (win), select."
